      "acceptedByNote": "The brochure says CET scores are used by all Government of Maharashtra management education institutes, university departments of management education, university-managed management institutes, and all un-aided management education institutes covered by the Act. The CAP portal lists the participating institutes and choice codes. Institute-wise CAP Round I closing percentiles are in mah-mba-cap-cutoffs.json.",
